WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.080
Unit twenty-five. Setting Health Goals!

2
00:00:05.022 --> 00:00:08.844
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:11.864
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.914 --> 00:00:15.681
Today we learn about Setting Health Goals. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.831 --> 00:00:20.431
SMART goal. Say it with me. SMART goal!

6
00:00:23.939 --> 00:00:27.573
Specific. Say it with me. Specific!

7
00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:34.525
Measurable. Say it with me. Measurable!

8
00:00:37.964 --> 00:00:41.331
Achievable. Say it with me. Achievable!

9
00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:48.338
Realistic. Say it with me. Realistic!

10
00:00:51.797 --> 00:00:54.963
Time-bound. Say it with me. Time-bound!

11
00:00:58.464 --> 00:01:01.530
Track. Say it with me. Track!

12
00:01:05.084 --> 00:01:08.484
Review. Say it with me. Review!

13
00:01:11.974 --> 00:01:19.806
A SMART goal is specific, measurable, achievable, realistic, and time-bound. I track my progress and review it each week to stay on track.

14
00:01:19.856 --> 00:01:22.791
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.182 --> 00:01:29.405
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:30.605
Measurable!

17
00:01:31.484 --> 00:01:36.412
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:37.612
Track!

19
00:01:38.371 --> 00:01:43.080
Did you know? Writing down your goal makes it more likely you will achieve it!

20
00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.834
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.533 --> 00:01:52.633
Think and answer. Write one SMART health goal.

22
00:01:52.683 --> 00:01:53.833
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.887 --> 00:02:02.386
Excellent work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 8. Keep making healthy choices, and see you in Grade 9. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.436 --> 00:02:05.438
Thank you, Doctor Visal! See you in Grade 9!

